そうか？","nextNodeIds":[732040402]},{"nodeId":732040402,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2545028842,"text":"もう解決したよ。","nextNodeIds":[732040403]},{"nodeId":732040403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":3062573850,"text":"死域で起きたことをアファンに伝えた。","nextNodeIds":[732040404]},{"nodeId":732040404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"アファン","textMapHash":592354650,"text":"なるほど、そういうことがあったのだな。何だっていきなり、土からあんなにたくさん黒いものが出て来たかと思えば。","nextNodeIds":[732040405]},{"nodeId":732040405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"アファン","textMapHash":3414176322,"text":"よしよし。これで安心して種を植えられるな。","nextNodeIds":[732040406]},{"nodeId":732040406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"アファン","textMapHash":3579968090,"text":"この三つの種が発芽して開花して、また新しい種になれば、それをまた畑に植える。そうすれば、ここは花いっぱいになるぞ。","nextNodeIds":[732040407]},{"nodeId":732040407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3430573834,"text":"えっと。これって…変な形の石か…？これで花が咲くのかよ？","nextNodeIds":[732040408]},{"nodeId":732040408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3272812730,"text":"アファンじいちゃん。これ、どこから買ってきたんだ？まさか騙されてないよな。","nextNodeIds":[732040409]},{"nodeId":732040409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"アファン","textMapHash":3553011866,"text":"チビ助は優しい子だな。だが大丈夫、これはモラでは買えん花の種なのだ。","nextNodeIds":[732040410]},{"nodeId":732040410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"アファン","textMapHash":2299420914,"text":"この三つは化け…コホン…ある友人がくれた大事な種だ。普通の果物や花の苗とは違うぞ。","nextNodeIds":[732040411]},{"nodeId":732040411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3929320618,"text":"ますます怪しくなってきたぞ。アファンじいちゃん、いったいなにを育ててるんだ？","nextNodeIds":[732040412]},{"nodeId":732040412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"アファン","textMapHash":2165725114,"text":"ふふ。これはある友人からの頼みでな。彼の願いなのだよ。","nextNodeIds":[732040413]},{"nodeId":732040413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3861701266,"text":"変な答えだな…これって育てられるものなのか？","nextNodeIds":[732040414]},{"nodeId":732040414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"アファン","textMapHash":3834084538,"text":"チビ助、お前に言ってもわからんだろう。またの機会に来てみてくれ。","nextNodeIds":[732040415]},{"nodeId":732040415,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"アファン","textMapHash":1684495738,"text":"ここは今は空っぽだが、この苗畑にある三つの種はいつか発芽して開花するぞ。","nextNodeIds":[732040416]},{"nodeId":732040416,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"アファン","textMapHash":3806965586,"text":"こいつらが沢山生えて…はは、その時には絶対立派になるぞ。","nextNodeIds":[732040417]},{"nodeId":732040417,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"アファン","textMapHash":334725330,"text":"まあいい。依頼したからには、報酬はちゃんと支払うぞ。","nextNodeIds":[732040418]},{"nodeId":732040418,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4233,"speakerName":"アファン","textMapHash":3144124218,"text":"受け取ってくれ。多くはないが、それで全部だ。","nextNodeIds":[732040419]},{"nodeId":732040419,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":84103210,"text":"ふぅ。依頼完成だ。半日走り回ったらお腹がすいてきたぞ。","nextNodeIds":[732040420]},{"nodeId":732040420,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2795551498,"text":"#走り回ったのは{M#俺}{F#私}だけど。","nextNodeIds":[732040421]},{"nodeId":732040421,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":152391554,"text":"オイラだってずっと話してやってたじゃないか。話すのだって、結構エネルギーを消耗するんだぞ。","nextNodeIds":[732040422]},{"nodeId":732040422,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1559610650,"text":"#ケチケチするなよ、{NICKNAME}。報酬で美味しいものを食べて自分に褒美をやろうぜ。どうだ？","nextNodeIds":[732040423]},{"nodeId":732040423,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3124070482,"text":"報酬はどれくらいあるかな？なにが食べられそうか、早く見てみようぜ。","nextNodeIds":[732040424]},{"nodeId":732040424,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":979729010,"text":"見てみる。","nextNodeIds":[732040425]},{"nodeId":732040425,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2870459442,"text":"へえ、モラより、食べ物のほうが入ってるな…シャワルマサンドにタフチーンに…それから野菜がいっぱい。","nextNodeIds":[732040426]},{"nodeId":732040426,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2810245754,"text":"でもこれはいくらなんでも多すぎるぞ。オイラたち…アファンじいちゃんの一日分の食料をもらっちゃったのか…？","nextNodeIds":[732040427]},{"nodeId":732040427,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":672609554,"text":"アファンじいちゃんは一人で村の外に住んでて、大変そうだよな。","nextNodeIds":[732040428]},{"nodeId":732040428,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1998903786,"text":"モラはまだしも、食料までもらっちゃうと。うぅ…ちょっと重く感じてきたぞ。","nextNodeIds":[732040429]},{"nodeId":732040429,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":707819330,"text":"それに、石みたいな種を植えて、それが…願いとか言ってたよな？","nextNodeIds":[732040430]},{"nodeId":732040430,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1548214202,"text":"一人暮らしが長すぎて、幻覚でも見てるんじゃないか？","nextNodeIds":[732040431]},{"nodeId":732040431,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4102568794,"text":"考えるほど心配になってきた。時間があったら様子を見に行こうぜ。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7320404,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["4233"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLI